  <div class="ambient" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="cloud cloud-a"></span><span class="cloud cloud-b"></span>
    <span class="glint glint-a">✦</span><span class="glint glint-b">✦</span><span class="glint glint-c">✧</span>
  </div>
  <div class="floating-motifs" aria-hidden="true">
    <span style="left:5%;top:13%;--drift:22px;--delay:-1s">✦</span><span style="left:17%;top:35%;--drift:-18px;--delay:-4s">♡</span>
    <span style="left:31%;top:8%;--drift:16px;--delay:-2s">★</span><span style="left:46%;top:27%;--drift:-22px;--delay:-5s">✧</span>
    <span style="left:63%;top:11%;--drift:19px;--delay:-3s">♡</span><span style="left:78%;top:39%;--drift:-16px;--delay:-6s">✦</span>
    <span style="left:92%;top:18%;--drift:20px;--delay:-1.5s">★</span><span style="left:9%;top:67%;--drift:-17px;--delay:-5.5s">✧</span>
    <span style="left:24%;top:82%;--drift:21px;--delay:-2.5s">♡</span><span style="left:40%;top:61%;--drift:-15px;--delay:-4.5s">✦</span>
    <span style="left:57%;top:88%;--drift:18px;--delay:-.5s">★</span><span style="left:71%;top:69%;--drift:-23px;--delay:-3.5s">♡</span>
    <span style="left:86%;top:84%;--drift:16px;--delay:-6.5s">✧</span><span style="left:96%;top:57%;--drift:-18px;--delay:-2.2s">✦</span>
  </div>
  <img class="botanical-decor botanical-top" src="assets/duck-friends-decor.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true">
  <img class="botanical-decor botanical-bottom" src="assets/duck-friends-decor.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true">

  <button class="sound-button" id="soundButton" type="button" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Putar musik">
    <span class="sound-bars" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
    <span id="soundLabel">play our song</span>
  </button>

  <main>
    <section class="scene intro-scene is-active" id="intro" aria-labelledby="introTitle">
      <div class="intro-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">a tiny birthday trip · made for your bestie</p>
        <h1 id="introTitle"><span class="title-line">Hi, Birthday Girl</span><em class="title-line">Dlynn!</em></h1>
        <p>Selamat ulang tahun! Semoga semua doa baikmu terkabul. Ada kejutan kecil yang menunggumu. Siap?</p>
        <div class="intro-detail" aria-label="Birthday edition, 27 September">
          <span>27 · 09</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i><small>one new level unlocked</small>
        </div>
        <button class="primary-button" id="startButton" type="button">mulai ceritanya <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
      </div>
      <div class="postcard" aria-hidden="true">
        <img class="postcard-photo" src="assets/dlynn-cover.jpeg" alt="">
        <span class="postcard-line line-one"></span><span class="postcard-line line-two"></span>
        <strong>to: birthday girl</strong><small>one year brighter<br>still my favorite<br>bestie</small>
      </div>
      <p class="scroll-note">built with good memories & a little mischief</p>
    </section>

    <section class="scene game-scene" id="game" aria-labelledby="gameTitle" hidden>
      <header class="scene-heading">
        <p class="step-label">01 · catch the good things</p>
        <h2 id="gameTitle">Tangkap <span>7 little joys</span></h2>
        <p>Geser keranjang dengan jari, mouse, atau tombol panah.</p>
      </header>
      <div class="game-status" aria-live="polite"><strong id="score">0</strong><span>/ 7 caught</span></div>
      <div class="catch-field" id="catchField" tabindex="0" aria-label="Permainan menangkap bintang">
        <div class="basket" id="basket" aria-hidden="true"><span></span></div>
      </div>
      <button class="secondary-button" id="gameSkip" type="button">lewati permainan</button>
    </section>

    <section class="scene picnic-scene" id="picnic" aria-labelledby="picnicTitle" hidden>
      <header class="scene-heading">
        <p class="step-label">02 · pack a sunny picnic</p>
        <h2 id="picnicTitle">Siapkan <span>piknik bebek</span></h2>
        <p>Tarik setiap benda ke tempat bergaris yang sesuai di atas tikar.</p>
      </header>
      <div class="picnic-game" id="picnicGame">
        <div class="picnic-tray" aria-label="Perlengkapan piknik">
          <button class="picnic-item" type="button" data-picnic-item="juice" aria-label="Jus untuk area minuman"><span>🧃</span><small>jus</small></button>
          <button class="picnic-item" type="button" data-picnic-item="sandwich" aria-label="Roti lapis untuk area makanan"><span>🥪</span><small>sandwich</small></button>
          <button class="picnic-item" type="button" data-picnic-item="berries" aria-label="Stroberi untuk area buah"><span>🍓</span><small>berry</small></button>
          <button class="picnic-item" type="button" data-picnic-item="flower" aria-label="Bunga untuk area dekorasi"><span>🌼</span><small>bunga</small></button>
        </div>
        <div class="picnic-blanket" id="picnicBlanket" aria-label="Tikar piknik">
          <button class="picnic-slot" type="button" data-accept="juice"><small>minuman</small></button>
          <button class="picnic-slot" type="button" data-accept="sandwich"><small>makanan</small></button>
          <button class="picnic-slot" type="button" data-accept="berries"><small>buah</small></button>
          <button class="picnic-slot" type="button" data-accept="flower"><small>dekorasi</small></button>
          <span class="picnic-duck" aria-hidden="true">🦆</span>
        </div>
        <p class="picnic-status" id="picnicStatus" aria-live="polite">0 dari 4 sudah siap</p>
      </div>
      <button class="secondary-button" id="picnicSkip" type="button">lewati permainan</button>
    </section>

    <section class="scene maze-scene" id="maze" aria-labelledby="mazeTitle" hidden>
      <header class="scene-heading">
        <p class="step-label">03 · a tiny duck delivery</p>
        <h2 id="mazeTitle">Antarkan <span>kado kecil</span></h2>
        <p>Seret bebek pembawa kado sampai ke sahabatnya. Tidak ada rintangan—ikuti saja jejak kuningnya.</p>
      </header>
      <div class="maze-game">
        <div class="duck-maze easy-duck-trail" id="duckMaze" tabindex="0" aria-label="Seret bebek pembawa kado menuju sahabatnya atau gunakan tombol panah.">
          <span class="maze-route" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="trail-spark trail-spark-one" aria-hidden="true">✦</span>
          <span class="trail-spark trail-spark-two" aria-hidden="true">♡</span>
          <span class="trail-spark trail-spark-three" aria-hidden="true">✦</span>
          <span class="pond-target" id="pondTarget" aria-hidden="true"><b>🐥</b><small>bestie</small></span>
          <button class="maze-duck" id="mazeDuck" type="button" aria-label="Bebek pembawa kado yang harus diseret">🦆<i>🎁</i></button>
        </div>
        <p class="maze-status" id="mazeStatus" aria-live="polite">Tahan bebeknya, lalu seret menuju sahabatnya.</p>
      </div>
      <button class="secondary-button" id="mazeSkip" type="button">lewati permainan</button>
    </section>

<section class="scene reflex-scene" id="reflex" aria-labelledby="reflexTitle" hidden>
      <div class="reflex-copy">
        <p class="step-label">04 · catch the sunshine</p>
        <h2 id="reflexTitle">Kejar <span>7 little suns</span></h2>
        <p>Ketuk target yang menyala. Setiap kena, posisinya akan berpindah.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="signal-score" aria-live="polite"><strong id="signalScore">0</strong><span>/ 7 locked</span></div>
      <div class="signal-field" id="signalField" aria-label="Permainan mengejar target kuning">
        <span class="signal-orbit orbit-one" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="signal-orbit orbit-two" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="signal-dot dot-one" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="signal-dot dot-two" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="signal-dot dot-three" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <button class="signal-target" id="signalTarget" type="button" aria-label="Tangkap cahaya kuning"><span>✦</span><small>tap</small></button>
        <div class="signal-progress" aria-hidden="true"><i id="signalProgress"></i></div>
        <p id="signalMessage">signal ready</p>
      </div>
      <button class="secondary-button signal-skip" id="signalSkip" type="button">lewati permainan</button>
    </section>

    <section class="scene puzzle-scene" id="puzzle" aria-labelledby="puzzleTitle" hidden>
      <div class="note-card">
        <p class="step-label">05 · three words for you</p>
        <h2 id="puzzleTitle">Tiga kata bersembunyi di sini</h2>
        <p>Tarik garis lurus di atas huruf untuk menemukan <strong>DEEPTALK</strong>, <strong>KULINER</strong>, dan <strong>DLYNN</strong>.</p>
        <div class="found-list" id="foundList" aria-live="polite"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="word-grid-wrap">
        <div class="word-grid" id="wordGrid" aria-label="Teka-teki pencarian kata"></div>
        <div class="clue-line" id="clueLine" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <p class="grid-hint" id="gridHint">0 dari 3 ditemukan</p>
        <p class="clue-note" id="clueNote" aria-live="polite"></p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="scene pin-scene" id="pin" aria-labelledby="pinTitle" hidden>
      <div class="pin-card">
        <p class="step-label">06 · one last lock</p>
        <h2 id="pinTitle">Enter PIN</h2>
        <p>tanggal yang selalu layak dirayakan</p>
        <div class="pin-dots" id="pinDots" aria-label="PIN 4 digit"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
        <p class="pin-error" id="pinError" aria-live="polite"></p>
        <div class="keypad" aria-label="Papan angka">
          <button type="button" data-digit="1">1</button><button type="button" data-digit="2">2</button><button type="button" data-digit="3">3</button>
          <button type="button" data-digit="4">4</button><button type="button" data-digit="5">5</button><button type="button" data-digit="6">6</button>
          <button type="button" data-digit="7">7</button><button type="button" data-digit="8">8</button><button type="button" data-digit="9">9</button>
          <span></span><button type="button" data-digit="0">0</button><button type="button" id="pinDelete" aria-label="Hapus angka">⌫</button>
        </div>
        <button class="primary-button compact" id="unlockButton" type="button">unlock it</button>
        <small>clue: DDMM ulang tahunmu</small>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="story" id="story" hidden>
      <div class="story-hero reveal">
        <p class="eyebrow">you made it, birthday girl</p>
        <h2>Dlynn, selamat ulang tahun bes💐</h2>
        <div class="story-opening-copy">
          <p>Hampir semua hal seru di hidupku ada kamu di dalamnya. Kulineran, deeptalk sampai lupa waktu, jalan-jalan nggak jelas sampai ngeratain semua jalan di Wonosobo wkwk, semuanya lebih seru kalau bareng pokoknya.</p>
          <p>Makasih ya udah jadi sahabat yang selalu ada, pas seneng maupun pas aku lagi berantakan meskipun masih suka berantem karna banyaknya perbedaan pendapat dan banyaknya perdebatan karna ga sejalan.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mixtape-player" aria-labelledby="playlistTitle">
          <div class="record-wrap" aria-hidden="true"><div class="record"><span></span></div></div>
          <div class="mixtape-content">
            <div class="mixtape-head"><span>side A · our soundtrack</span><strong id="playlistTitle">Now playing</strong></div>
            <div class="track-list">
              <button type="button" class="track is-selected" data-track="0"><span>01</span><strong>BIRDS OF A FEATHER</strong><small>Billie Eilish</small><b>play</b></button>
              <button type="button" class="track" data-track="1"><span>02</span><strong>WILDFLOWER</strong><small>Billie Eilish</small><b>play</b></button>
              <button type="button" class="track" data-track="2"><span>03</span><strong>PILLOWTALK</strong><small>ZAYN</small><b>play</b></button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <a href="#memories" class="down-link">buka kenangannya <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
      </div>

      <section class="memories" id="memories" aria-labelledby="memoriesTitle">
        <header class="section-title reveal">
          <span>our little archive</span>
          <h3 id="memoriesTitle">This is where our chaos lives.</h3>
        </header>
        <p class="flip-hint reveal">tap each photo to flip it</p>
        <div class="photo-river">
          <button class="memory-card tilt-left reveal" type="button" aria-pressed="false"><span class="memory-card-inner"><span class="memory-front"><img src="assets/dlynn-memory-1.jpeg" alt="Deeptalk bersama sahabat" loading="lazy"><i>tap to flip</i></span><span class="memory-back"><small>memory 01</small><strong>Deeptalk sampai lupa waktu, lupa pulang juga.</strong><em>tap to return</em></span></span></button>
          <button class="memory-card tilt-right reveal" type="button" aria-pressed="false"><span class="memory-card-inner"><span class="memory-front"><img src="assets/dlynn-memory-2.jpeg" alt="Jalan-jalan bersama sahabat" loading="lazy"><i>tap to flip</i></span><span class="memory-back"><small>memory 02</small><strong>Jalan tanpa tujuan, tapi seru terus.</strong><em>tap to return</em></span></span></button>
          <button class="memory-card tilt-left reveal" type="button" aria-pressed="false"><span class="memory-card-inner"><span class="memory-front"><img src="assets/dlynn-memory-3.jpeg" alt="Kulineran bersama sahabat" loading="lazy"><i>tap to flip</i></span><span class="memory-back"><small>memory 03</small><strong>Partner kulineran terbaik—dompet boleh tipis, asal perut senang.</strong><em>tap to return</em></span></span></button>
          <button class="memory-card tilt-right reveal" type="button" aria-pressed="false"><span class="memory-card-inner"><span class="memory-front"><img src="assets/dlynn-memory-4.jpeg" alt="Momen bahagia bersama sahabat" loading="lazy"><i>tap to flip</i></span><span class="memory-back"><small>memory 04</small><strong>Semoga kamu selalu sebahagia ini, dan kita masih bisa bikin foto konyol bareng.</strong><em>tap to return</em></span></span></button>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="letter-section">
        <div class="letter-paper reveal">
          <p class="letter-date">27 September · untuk Dlynn</p>
          <h3>lappy birthday</h3>
          <p>Another year older, another level unlocked. Semoga di umur yang sekarang, semua hal baik makin deket ke kamu.</p>
          <p>Makasih juga udah jadi orang yang selalu punya vibes asik, bisa diajak cerita, bercanda, bahkan di momen receh sekalipun. Honestly ga semua orang bisa bikin orang lain ngerasa nyaman cuma lewat presence mereka, but you do.</p>
          <p>Semoga tahun ini banyak hal yang berjalan sesuai harapan kamu. Kalaupun ada yang ga sesuai plan, semoga diganti sama sesuatu yang ternyata lebih baik. Jangan lupa juga buat take care of yourself, istirahat yang cukup, makan yang bener, dan stop overthinking hal-hal yang sebenernya belum tentu kejadian.</p>
          <p>I wish you more happiness, more good people around you, more opportunities, and obviously more money karena kita butuh itu buat survive, wkwk.</p>
          <p>Tetep jadi orang yang seru, tulus, dan punya cara unik buat bikin orang lain ketawa. Semoga semua yang kamu usahain pelan-pelan bisa ke achieve satu-satu. And semoga tahun ini kamu lebih banyak ketawa daripada sedihnya.</p>
          <p>Once again, happy birthday. Hope this year treats you way better than the last one.</p>
          <div class="signature">always on your side,<br><strong>i see</strong></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="celebration-lab reveal" aria-labelledby="celebrationTitle">
        <header><p class="step-label">final two moves</p><h3 id="celebrationTitle">Tiup lilinnya.<br>Lalu buka kadonya.</h3></header>
        <div class="party-actions">
          <div class="cake-station" id="cakeStation">
            <div class="cake" aria-hidden="true"><span class="candle"><i class="flame" id="flame"></i></span><b></b><b></b></div>
            <button class="action-button candle-hold" id="blowButton" type="button" style="--blow-progress:0%"><span aria-hidden="true">✦</span><strong>Tahan untuk meniup</strong></button>
            <small id="blowStatus">tekan dan tahan sampai apinya padam</small>
            <div class="candle-message" id="candleMessage" aria-live="polite">
              <span>YOUR WISH IS ON ITS WAY</span>
              <strong>Doamu sudah terbang ✦</strong>
              <p>Semoga semesta mendengar semuanya, dan hal-hal baik selalu menemukan jalan pulang kepadamu.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="gift-station">
            <button class="gift-box" id="giftBox" type="button" aria-expanded="false" disabled><span class="gift-lid"></span><span class="gift-body"></span><i>?</i></button>
            <div class="gift-hearts" id="giftHearts" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <strong id="giftLabel">tiup lilin dulu</strong>
            <p id="giftMessage" aria-live="polite"></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="wish-section reveal">
        <div class="jar-heading">
          <p>one last little game</p>
          <h3>Kumpulkan lima bintang kecil.</h3>
          <span>Ketuk satu per satu dan simpan semuanya di dalam jar.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="star-jar-game" id="starJarGame">
          <img src="assets/blue-star-jar.png" alt="Jar kuning untuk mengumpulkan bintang" loading="lazy">
          <button class="jar-star jar-star-1" type="button" aria-label="Masukkan bintang 1 ke jar">★</button>
          <button class="jar-star jar-star-2" type="button" aria-label="Masukkan bintang 2 ke jar">✦</button>
          <button class="jar-star jar-star-3" type="button" aria-label="Masukkan bintang 3 ke jar">★</button>
          <button class="jar-star jar-star-4" type="button" aria-label="Masukkan bintang 4 ke jar">✦</button>
          <button class="jar-star jar-star-5" type="button" aria-label="Masukkan bintang 5 ke jar">★</button>
          <div class="jar-fill" id="jarFill" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <div class="jar-counter" aria-live="polite"><strong id="jarCount">0/5</strong><span>bintang terkumpul</span></div>
        </div>
        <p class="jar-reveal" id="jarReveal" aria-live="polite"></p>
        <button class="wish-button" id="wishButton" type="button" disabled>make a wish ✦</button>
        <h3 class="wish-final" id="wishFinal">Semoga kamu selalu sehat, bahagia, dan dikelilingi orang-orang baik. Semoga impianmu satu per satu jadi nyata, dan kita masih bisa kulineran serta deeptalk bareng di banyak ulang tahun berikutnya.</h3>
        <div class="wish-result" id="wishResult" aria-live="polite"></div>
      </section>

      <footer><span>made for one special bestie</span><span>stay bright · stay dlynn</span><span>2026</span></footer>
    </section>
  </main>

  <div class="transition-wash" id="transitionWash" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="flower-transition-backdrop"></div>
